1
00:01:36,570 --> 00:01:38,970
[The Lament of Autumn]

2
00:01:39,380 --> 00:01:41,850
[Episode 27]

3
00:01:41,979 --> 00:01:44,860
[Nanhuai Military General
Staff Department]

4
00:01:42,509 --> 00:01:43,979
We found another

5
00:01:44,070 --> 00:01:45,120
black market arms dealer

6
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,620
who had dealings with Cai Fuhu.

7
00:01:46,620 --> 00:01:47,570
According to his confession,

8
00:01:47,570 --> 00:01:48,560
outside Laifu Teahouse,

9
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,840
there is a wooden sign
hanging all year round

10
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,100
for buying tea leaves.

11
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:53,640
"Buying premium Longjing today"

12
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:54,570
means a meeting.

13
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,840
"Buying Huangshan Maofeng today"

14
00:01:57,140 --> 00:01:58,940
means there's a change of plans.

15
00:01:59,340 --> 00:02:01,290
Cai Fuhu's rank is low.

16
00:02:01,370 --> 00:02:02,970
He's just a front man at best.

17
00:02:03,930 --> 00:02:05,780
But the person he meets

18
00:02:06,930 --> 00:02:08,860
might be the one we're looking for.

19
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:10,000
The manager of Laifu Teahouse

20
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,500
is already under our control.

21
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:13,030
The arrest of Cai Fuhu and his son

22
00:02:13,030 --> 00:02:14,430
is still being kept secret.

23
00:02:14,430 --> 00:02:16,090
We just said they were sent out on duty.

24
00:02:16,090 --> 00:02:18,150
And the waiters
and kitchen staff of the teahouse

25
00:02:18,150 --> 00:02:20,410
have all been replaced by our own people.

26
00:02:21,410 --> 00:02:22,579
This person
has been lying low for so long.

27
00:02:22,579 --> 00:02:23,960
He won't show up easily.

28
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:26,829
We have to set a trap for him.

29
00:02:27,690 --> 00:02:30,690
Well, let's spread the news through
the black market.

30
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:31,579
Just say

31
00:02:32,090 --> 00:02:33,340
that 600 German Bergmann submachine guns

32
00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:34,130
are about

33
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,760
to flow into Nanhuai.

34
00:02:36,060 --> 00:02:38,660
Then hang a sign for buying Longjing

35
00:02:38,870 --> 00:02:40,500
outside Laifu Teahouse

36
00:02:40,740 --> 00:02:42,540
and wait for him to take the bait.

37
00:02:53,090 --> 00:02:53,950
One Character.

38
00:02:56,870 --> 00:02:58,130
One Character too.

39
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,300
Seven Characters.

40
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:02,780
Kong.

41
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,590
Your luck today

42
00:03:04,590 --> 00:03:06,600
is truly unstoppable.

43
00:03:06,750 --> 00:03:08,030
The Fifth Young Master Yu and his wife

44
00:03:08,030 --> 00:03:09,230
have moved back home.

45
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,340
Baoru is happy.

46
00:03:11,410 --> 00:03:12,610
How could we possibly

47
00:03:12,620 --> 00:03:14,280
catch up with her luck?

48
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,630
What a demure beauty.

49
00:03:21,470 --> 00:03:22,240
Baoru,

50
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:23,970
someone has finally taken over

51
00:03:23,970 --> 00:03:25,710
your walnut-cracking duties.

52
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:28,780
He has someone
taking care of him in the future.

53
00:03:30,230 --> 00:03:31,230
Oh my.

54
00:03:31,300 --> 00:03:33,260
Speak of the devil.

55
00:03:34,829 --> 00:03:36,060
Looks like you ladies

56
00:03:36,190 --> 00:03:37,450
were talking about me.

57
00:03:37,710 --> 00:03:38,470
Changxuan,

58
00:03:38,710 --> 00:03:40,530
come look at my tiles.

59
00:03:40,550 --> 00:03:41,250
No need to look.

60
00:03:41,250 --> 00:03:42,910
I'll cover whatever you lose.

61
00:03:43,860 --> 00:03:44,800
This child.

62
00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:49,680
Stop cracking.
Be careful not to hurt your hands.

63
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,900
It's fine.

64
00:03:55,060 --> 00:03:56,910
I've cracked walnuts for so many years,

65
00:03:56,910 --> 00:03:57,630
and I've never seen

66
00:03:57,630 --> 00:03:59,210
him care so much.

67
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:01,150
I raised you for nothing.

68
00:04:02,620 --> 00:04:03,890
Look at them.

69
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,520
With such a

70
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,550
graceful wife,

71
00:04:07,780 --> 00:04:09,310
it's not hard

72
00:04:09,310 --> 00:04:11,840
for them to treat each other

73
00:04:11,930 --> 00:04:13,670
with mutual respect.

74
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,240
Yes, yes.

75
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:18,370
Such good fortune. Come on.

76
00:04:18,860 --> 00:04:19,930
I'm the lucky one.

77
00:04:22,670 --> 00:04:24,370
There are so many people here.

78
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:25,460
Stop talking.

79
00:04:26,570 --> 00:04:27,310
Pingjun!

80
00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:29,600
Pingjun! Pingjun!

81
00:04:31,370 --> 00:04:32,240
Let me tell you.

82
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,370
I started a club.

83
00:04:33,370 --> 00:04:34,450
Many friends have joined.

84
00:04:34,450 --> 00:04:35,360
You have to join too.

85
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:36,880
Hurry up and write your name down.

86
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:38,350
What club? A poetry club?

87
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,159
The club I started

88
00:04:40,159 --> 00:04:41,040
is all about

89
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,159
helping us girls.

90
00:04:42,270 --> 00:04:43,500
The spirit of the club is

91
00:04:43,500 --> 00:04:46,159
self-respect, self-love,
and self-reliance.

92
00:04:46,370 --> 00:04:47,180
Let me tell you,

93
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:48,370
I thought about it all night yesterday

94
00:04:48,370 --> 00:04:49,150
and finally came up with

95
00:04:49,150 --> 00:04:49,870
a good name.

96
00:04:50,180 --> 00:04:53,290
It's called the Heroine Club.

97
00:04:55,110 --> 00:04:56,920
That's the name you came up with
after a whole night?

98
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,650
Yu Changxuan, what do you mean?

99
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:01,950
Pingjun, you...

100
00:05:02,570 --> 00:05:04,430
Mom, Mom, be the judge here.

101
00:05:04,430 --> 00:05:05,310
Look at the two of them,

102
00:05:05,310 --> 00:05:06,680
ganging up to bully me.

103
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,710
You have a lot of nerve

104
00:05:08,740 --> 00:05:10,600
to mess with those two.

105
00:05:10,620 --> 00:05:11,510
They are

106
00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:13,460
thick as thieves.

107
00:05:17,540 --> 00:05:18,470
Qixuan.

108
00:05:19,100 --> 00:05:21,370
In ancient times, Hua Mulan
joined the army in her father's place.

109
00:05:21,370 --> 00:05:22,600
As the opera says,

110
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,190
"Who says women are inferior to men?"

111
00:05:24,190 --> 00:05:26,890
Why don't you call this Mulan Club?

112
00:05:27,310 --> 00:05:28,540
Mulan Club.

113
00:05:29,890 --> 00:05:30,690
Yes.

114
00:05:30,930 --> 00:05:31,690
That's a good name.

115
00:05:31,690 --> 00:05:32,500
Let's call it Mulan Club then.

116
00:05:32,500 --> 00:05:33,960
Why didn't I think of that?

117
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:35,159
Changxuan.

118
00:05:35,180 --> 00:05:36,270
I need to borrow your Fengtai by then.

119
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:37,400
I need to be the host.

120
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:39,360
Pingjun, you came up with this name.

121
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,310
So you're involved.

122
00:05:40,310 --> 00:05:41,950
You must attend too.

123
00:05:46,130 --> 00:05:47,730
Serve them to everyone.

124
00:05:47,980 --> 00:05:50,240
Great. I was just about to say I'm hungry.

125
00:05:57,750 --> 00:05:58,560
Enjoy.

126
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,120
You like this?

127
00:06:06,980 --> 00:06:08,310
This is very delicious.

128
00:06:08,420 --> 00:06:09,930
Really? Let me try.

129
00:06:40,770 --> 00:06:41,550
[Yuxingsheng]

130
00:06:42,020 --> 00:06:43,500
[Nanshan White Maojian]
[West Lake Longjing] [Guidong Linglong]

131
00:06:43,570 --> 00:06:49,150
[Buying Longjing]

132
00:06:57,280 --> 00:07:01,380
[Yuxingsheng]

133
00:07:00,010 --> 00:07:01,070
You found nothing?

134
00:07:02,070 --> 00:07:02,730
Don't move.

135
00:07:04,930 --> 00:07:05,590
Be careful.

136
00:07:14,630 --> 00:07:15,130
Speak.

137
00:07:15,860 --> 00:07:16,520
Changxuan.

138
00:07:16,870 --> 00:07:17,800
Someone just booked

139
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:20,130
the private room Cai Fuhu usually goes to.

140
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:22,620
Boren and I have already set up an ambush.

141
00:07:40,270 --> 00:07:41,420
Sir, are you alone

142
00:07:41,420 --> 00:07:42,500
or do you have a companion?

143
00:07:42,500 --> 00:07:43,920
Room Qingfeng.

144
00:07:44,430 --> 00:07:45,430
Please follow me.

145
00:08:04,070 --> 00:08:05,600
Sir, here is Room Qingfeng.

146
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:18,260
[Qingfeng Hall]

147
00:08:24,270 --> 00:08:25,070
Waiter.

148
00:08:26,220 --> 00:08:27,480
I remembered it wrong.

149
00:08:27,870 --> 00:08:29,400
I want to go to Qinglan Hall.

150
00:08:30,310 --> 00:08:31,480
It's on the first floor.

151
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,610
I'll take you there.

152
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:03,130
Something's wrong.

153
00:09:11,050 --> 00:09:11,580
Hurry!

154
00:09:11,820 --> 00:09:13,390
[Yuxingsheng]

155
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,890
-Let's split up!
-Let's go!

156
00:09:19,890 --> 00:09:20,370
Hurry!

157
00:09:29,140 --> 00:09:31,900
[Where Guests Gather]

158
00:09:29,910 --> 00:09:30,440
Let's go!

159
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:31,790
Hurry!

160
00:09:34,410 --> 00:09:34,990
This way!

161
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:40,160
After him!

162
00:10:00,390 --> 00:10:01,790
Did you see where he went?

163
00:10:03,870 --> 00:10:04,410
Sir!

164
00:10:04,620 --> 00:10:06,170
Sir! We found him!

165
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,920
He's in the alley over there!

166
00:10:55,810 --> 00:11:01,680
[Nanhuai Orphanage]

167
00:11:01,740 --> 00:11:06,360
[Infirmary]

168
00:11:12,150 --> 00:11:13,080
Cough.

169
00:11:16,700 --> 00:11:18,200
She just caught a cold.

170
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,080
It's not serious.

171
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,720
She'll be fine after taking medicine
for a couple of days.

172
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:21,120
For the next few days,

173
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:22,080
don't let her take part

174
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:23,320
in any outdoor activities.

175
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:23,790
Okay.

176
00:11:23,860 --> 00:11:25,250
Thank you so much, Dr. Yu.

177
00:11:25,250 --> 00:11:26,180
You're welcome.

178
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:27,130
Thank you.

179
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:28,730
Goodbye.

180
00:11:28,890 --> 00:11:31,020
Did you remember what the doctor said?

181
00:11:31,740 --> 00:11:32,270
Let's go.

182
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:43,820
Jinxuan, have an orange.

183
00:11:44,930 --> 00:11:45,730
Come in.

184
00:11:49,410 --> 00:11:50,050
Sit down.

185
00:11:51,890 --> 00:11:53,130
I'll peel the orange

186
00:11:53,130 --> 00:11:55,530
and make you a little orange lantern,
okay?

187
00:12:20,550 --> 00:12:22,940
Jinxuan, are you sick?

188
00:12:23,370 --> 00:12:24,430
I'm fine. I'm fine.

189
00:12:36,820 --> 00:12:37,890
Kuang Bingwen,

190
00:12:38,670 --> 00:12:40,250
I will hate you.

191
00:12:40,890 --> 00:12:42,220
In that case,

192
00:12:42,500 --> 00:12:43,300
I might as well

193
00:12:43,310 --> 00:12:45,010
let you hate me to the end!

194
00:12:57,290 --> 00:12:58,430
The deceased, Zhao Wu,

195
00:12:58,430 --> 00:13:00,520
belonged to the Fourth Army
along with Cai Fuhu.

196
00:13:00,520 --> 00:13:02,150
But according to our investigation,

197
00:13:02,150 --> 00:13:03,480
there was no connection

198
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:04,860
between the two of them.

199
00:13:03,760 --> 00:13:08,580
[Where Music and Books Bring Joy]

200
00:13:05,130 --> 00:13:07,060
We don't know why he appeared here.

201
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:25,680
[Where Music and Books Bring Joy]

202
00:13:23,700 --> 00:13:24,700
Brother-in-law.

203
00:13:27,890 --> 00:13:29,690
You really are a married man now.

204
00:13:29,770 --> 00:13:30,860
In the past,

205
00:13:31,130 --> 00:13:32,150
you wouldn't come home for a meal

206
00:13:32,150 --> 00:13:33,150
even once a month.

207
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,130
But now,

208
00:13:34,620 --> 00:13:36,350
you rush home on time every day.

209
00:13:47,150 --> 00:13:49,080
Why are you looking at me like this?

210
00:13:50,620 --> 00:13:52,230
I feel like you've been

211
00:13:52,270 --> 00:13:54,600
a bit different lately, Brother-in-law.

212
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:57,200
How so?

213
00:13:58,700 --> 00:14:00,160
I can't put my finger on it.

214
00:14:00,890 --> 00:14:02,750
You seem to have a lot on your mind.

215
00:14:04,820 --> 00:14:06,750
Like you've encountered a problem

216
00:14:06,750 --> 00:14:08,460
that even you can't solve.

217
00:14:14,100 --> 00:14:16,340
Mr. Bingwen! Mr. Bingwen!

218
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:19,060
[Where Music and Books Bring Joy]

219
00:14:17,270 --> 00:14:18,530
Fifth Young Master, you're here too?

220
00:14:18,530 --> 00:14:20,620
Mr. Bingwen, great news!

221
00:14:20,870 --> 00:14:21,510
Just now,

222
00:14:21,630 --> 00:14:22,540
Director Zhang from the orphanage

223
00:14:22,540 --> 00:14:23,270
called to say

224
00:14:23,270 --> 00:14:25,320
that Fourth Lady is pregnant.

225
00:14:38,220 --> 00:14:39,500
Do Father and Mother know about it?

226
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:40,340
Yes.

227
00:14:40,340 --> 00:14:41,530
They are overjoyed.

228
00:14:41,650 --> 00:14:42,510
They are waiting for you

229
00:14:42,510 --> 00:14:44,010
to bring Fourth Lady back
as soon as possible.

230
00:14:44,010 --> 00:14:49,870
[Where Music and Books Bring Joy]

231
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:45,420
Thank you, Mr. Tai.

232
00:14:45,650 --> 00:14:46,270
Go now.

233
00:14:46,500 --> 00:14:47,830
I'll take my leave then.

234
00:14:56,650 --> 00:14:57,390
Changxuan.

235
00:14:58,320 --> 00:15:00,050
Actually, over the past few days,

236
00:15:00,050 --> 00:15:00,830
Jinxuan and I

237
00:15:00,850 --> 00:15:02,650
have been having some problems.

238
00:15:02,790 --> 00:15:04,250
She moved to the orphanage

239
00:15:04,410 --> 00:15:06,340
and is giving me the cold shoulder.

240
00:15:06,340 --> 00:15:07,540
I've been in a bad mood

241
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,530
because of this.

242
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:17,940
So do you want me

243
00:15:18,510 --> 00:15:19,840
to go with you tomorrow?

244
00:15:20,890 --> 00:15:22,120
It's a matter between us
as husband and wife.

245
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,920
We should resolve it ourselves.

246
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:25,240
You two newlyweds

247
00:15:25,700 --> 00:15:27,300
are in your honeymoon phase.

248
00:15:28,360 --> 00:15:30,650
Now that Jinxuan is having a baby,

249
00:15:31,790 --> 00:15:33,960
rest assured. I'll give in

250
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,520
to her on everything.

251
00:15:37,410 --> 00:15:39,320
Congratulations, Brother-in-law.

252
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:41,580
I also hope you have a baby soon.

253
00:15:42,010 --> 00:15:43,470
It will bring even more joy

254
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:45,840
to our Yu family.

255
00:16:27,790 --> 00:16:29,250
Now that you're pregnant,

256
00:16:29,390 --> 00:16:31,410
you should work less and rest more.

257
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:33,610
If you need to buy anything,

258
00:16:34,100 --> 00:16:35,120
just let me know.

259
00:16:35,710 --> 00:16:36,840
During this time,

260
00:16:36,870 --> 00:16:38,870
I want us to sleep in separate rooms.

261
00:16:39,130 --> 00:16:40,790
You can stay in the guest room.

262
00:16:41,220 --> 00:16:42,360
In separate rooms?

263
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:43,700
Then how can I

264
00:16:43,700 --> 00:16:44,900
take good care of you?

265
00:16:45,910 --> 00:16:47,240
They say pregnant women

266
00:16:47,550 --> 00:16:49,250
can be childish.

267
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:51,200
It seems to be true.

268
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:55,980
Keeping up the act for decades

269
00:16:57,270 --> 00:16:58,460
must be hard for you.

270
00:17:05,750 --> 00:17:08,000
After decades,

271
00:17:09,810 --> 00:17:12,810
even the fake becomes real.

272
00:17:20,849 --> 00:17:22,329
From the very beginning,

273
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:24,720
I've been your only man.

274
00:17:25,589 --> 00:17:26,550
I am very clear

275
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:29,790
about that.

276
00:17:43,980 --> 00:17:45,380
Don't upset the baby.

277
00:17:46,140 --> 00:17:47,980
You must keep our baby safe.

278
00:18:27,490 --> 00:18:30,460
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

279
00:18:33,330 --> 00:18:35,310
How has the investigation been going
these past few days?

280
00:18:35,310 --> 00:18:35,920
Zhao Wu belonged to

281
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:37,830
the Seventh Regiment,
Third Division, Fourth Army.

282
00:18:37,830 --> 00:18:39,240
The regiment commander was Li Tianjun.

283
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:41,040
Zhao Wu was a company commander.

284
00:18:41,090 --> 00:18:42,330
His parents live in Siguqiao.

285
00:18:42,330 --> 00:18:44,590
He had an older brother
and an older sister.

286
00:18:44,590 --> 00:18:45,720
His family was poor,

287
00:18:45,750 --> 00:18:46,570
but he had a private room at Xinghua Hotel

288
00:18:46,570 --> 00:18:47,770
on a long-term basis.

289
00:18:50,010 --> 00:18:51,270
We found these inside.

290
00:19:01,330 --> 00:19:03,390
Zhao Wu was just a company commander.

291
00:19:04,070 --> 00:19:05,540
How could he have access

292
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:06,960
to weapons and firearms,

293
00:19:07,180 --> 00:19:09,440
and be able to mobilize and replace them?

294
00:19:09,770 --> 00:19:11,220
And he was bold enough to

295
00:19:11,550 --> 00:19:12,460
instruct Tong Chunhai

296
00:19:12,460 --> 00:19:13,740
to kidnap Pingjun.

297
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:18,860
What are your suspicions?

298
00:19:20,810 --> 00:19:22,410
Actually, Gu and I both think

299
00:19:23,030 --> 00:19:24,960
this person should be a scapegoat.

300
00:19:27,380 --> 00:19:28,590
You guys surrounded

301
00:19:28,610 --> 00:19:30,110
this mole that day,

302
00:19:30,110 --> 00:19:31,840
and he still managed to escape.

303
00:19:32,050 --> 00:19:33,030
If Zhao Wu came

304
00:19:33,030 --> 00:19:34,500
to help him escape,

305
00:19:35,290 --> 00:19:36,500
and he decided to kill him

306
00:19:36,500 --> 00:19:38,110
in such a short time,

307
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:41,090
that shows just how ruthless he is.

308
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:45,070
The top priority

309
00:19:45,530 --> 00:19:48,290
is to thoroughly investigate
everyone around Zhao Wu.

310
00:19:48,290 --> 00:19:49,740
Someone must have seen

311
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:52,200
him in contact with suspicious people.

312
00:20:00,510 --> 00:20:01,220
Qiuluo.

313
00:20:01,610 --> 00:20:03,130
I heard Madam reassigned you to serve

314
00:20:03,130 --> 00:20:04,390
the Fifth Young Madam.

315
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:08,590
No matter who we are serving,

316
00:20:08,900 --> 00:20:10,200
as servants,

317
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:11,860
we just need to do our best.

318
00:20:12,500 --> 00:20:14,250
You are so lucky.

319
00:20:14,510 --> 00:20:16,460
Before the Young Madam even moved in,

320
00:20:16,460 --> 00:20:17,720
the Fifth Young Master
personally supervised

321
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:18,830
the tidying of her room,

322
00:20:18,830 --> 00:20:20,160
making it look like a painting.

323
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:21,250
He even picked out the ornaments

324
00:20:21,250 --> 00:20:22,450
on the table himself.

325
00:20:22,750 --> 00:20:24,050
If you serve her well,

326
00:20:24,290 --> 00:20:24,810
won't you become

327
00:20:24,810 --> 00:20:25,700
a favorite of the Fifth Young Master

328
00:20:25,700 --> 00:20:26,830
and Young Madam?

329
00:20:27,090 --> 00:20:29,510
Yes, Qiuluo. Congratulations.

330
00:20:30,590 --> 00:20:31,570
Shut up.

331
00:20:32,590 --> 00:20:34,160
Who are you to gossip about

332
00:20:34,330 --> 00:20:35,380
the Fifth Young Master

333
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:36,440
and Young Madam?

334
00:20:37,090 --> 00:20:38,750
Hurry up and finish your work.

335
00:20:39,090 --> 00:20:40,530
I'm not gossiping.

336
00:20:40,720 --> 00:20:42,310
You see, the Fifth Young Master

337
00:20:42,310 --> 00:20:43,500
personally oversees

338
00:20:43,500 --> 00:20:45,140
the Fifth Young Madam's meals every day.

339
00:20:45,140 --> 00:20:46,440
She prefers light food,

340
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:47,550
so the menus in the residence

341
00:20:47,550 --> 00:20:49,550
have been changed to suit her taste.

342
00:20:49,590 --> 00:20:50,310
That's right.

343
00:20:50,310 --> 00:20:50,880
The Fifth Young Master

344
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:52,530
is such a busy man,

345
00:20:52,530 --> 00:20:55,130
yet he still remembers
these trivial matters.

346
00:20:55,250 --> 00:20:56,270
Even so,

347
00:20:56,590 --> 00:20:57,720
you mustn't gossip about

348
00:20:57,720 --> 00:20:59,920
the Fifth Young Master and Young Madam.

349
00:21:00,070 --> 00:21:01,180
Remember that.

350
00:21:01,570 --> 00:21:02,720
-Yes.
-Yes.

351
00:21:02,750 --> 00:21:03,250
Yes.

352
00:21:03,250 --> 00:21:04,420
Watch your tongues.

353
00:21:13,420 --> 00:21:15,770
Young Madam, the ginseng soup is ready.

354
00:21:15,900 --> 00:21:17,200
Drink it while it's hot.

355
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:17,730
Alright.

356
00:21:18,440 --> 00:21:19,680
This is

357
00:21:19,830 --> 00:21:21,560
the best thing for your health.

358
00:21:34,700 --> 00:21:36,960
Why is this soup so bitter?

359
00:21:38,110 --> 00:21:39,770
Good medicine tastes bitter.

360
00:21:39,880 --> 00:21:42,140
This is made with top-quality ginseng.

361
00:21:42,270 --> 00:21:43,200
Young Madam,

362
00:21:43,230 --> 00:21:44,560
you may not be used to it,

363
00:21:45,110 --> 00:21:47,110
but now that you're in our Yu family,

364
00:21:47,550 --> 00:21:49,110
you should get used to it.

365
00:21:55,090 --> 00:21:56,420
I'm not drinking this.

366
00:21:57,180 --> 00:21:58,050
Take it away.

367
00:21:58,680 --> 00:21:59,570
Young Madam.

368
00:22:00,310 --> 00:22:02,000
The Fifth Young Master has always

369
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:03,050
drunk it this way.

370
00:22:03,900 --> 00:22:06,000
In all these years, he's never left a drop

371
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:07,660
of the ginseng soup I've made.

372
00:22:08,140 --> 00:22:09,740
Even when he doesn't like it,

373
00:22:09,750 --> 00:22:10,790
he appreciates the fact

374
00:22:10,790 --> 00:22:11,530
that I spent hours

375
00:22:11,530 --> 00:22:13,500
making it for him

376
00:22:13,890 --> 00:22:15,580
and drinks every last drop.

377
00:22:18,140 --> 00:22:20,180
Well, you've certainly worked hard.

378
00:22:20,180 --> 00:22:21,980
I'll tell the Fifth Young Master

379
00:22:22,010 --> 00:22:23,190
that we have enough staff here

380
00:22:23,190 --> 00:22:24,450
and no longer need you.

381
00:22:24,660 --> 00:22:27,000
I'll send you back to the countryside
to get married.

382
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:29,000
I'll have someone arrange it tomorrow

383
00:22:29,000 --> 00:22:30,810
and have your parents come get you.

384
00:22:30,810 --> 00:22:32,340
No, please!

385
00:22:32,440 --> 00:22:34,290
Young Madam, I was wrong.

386
00:22:34,290 --> 00:22:36,350
Young Madam, I won't dare do it again.

387
00:22:36,350 --> 00:22:37,810
Please don't send me away.

388
00:22:38,790 --> 00:22:40,400
Do you really think

389
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:42,450
I'm some spoiled young lady

390
00:22:42,640 --> 00:22:44,440
who would be bullied by your words,

391
00:22:44,440 --> 00:22:46,280
fall for your little tricks,

392
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:48,400
and cry her eyes out?

393
00:22:49,050 --> 00:22:50,510
You're so wrong.

394
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:53,090
I'm not that forgiving.

395
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:56,500
Do you really think I can't deal with you?

396
00:23:02,830 --> 00:23:04,200
There are some things

397
00:23:04,750 --> 00:23:06,880
that are clearly beyond your control.

398
00:23:07,270 --> 00:23:09,110
Why go to such great lengths?

399
00:23:09,940 --> 00:23:11,090
Young Madam,

400
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:13,500
I know I was wrong.

401
00:23:13,500 --> 00:23:16,250
Young Madam, I won't dare do it again.

402
00:23:17,240 --> 00:23:18,290
I'm sorry.

403
00:23:22,750 --> 00:23:24,080
I'll let it go this time.

404
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:25,610
There won't be a next time.

405
00:23:25,610 --> 00:23:26,410
You may leave.

406
00:23:26,460 --> 00:23:27,460
Thank you, Young Madam.

407
00:23:27,460 --> 00:23:28,790
Thank you, Young Madam.

408
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:35,220
Officer Gu, I'm sorry.

409
00:23:36,610 --> 00:23:38,410
Is the Fifth Young Madam inside?

410
00:23:38,810 --> 00:23:39,480
Yes.

411
00:23:49,900 --> 00:23:50,550
Pingjun.

412
00:23:51,440 --> 00:23:53,550
Director Gu, what brings you here?

413
00:23:54,250 --> 00:23:56,290
Changxuan asked me
to drop off some documents.

414
00:23:56,290 --> 00:23:57,490
He'll be back in a bit.

415
00:23:59,030 --> 00:23:59,990
Why did you have to

416
00:23:59,990 --> 00:24:01,350
make the trip yourself?

417
00:24:01,740 --> 00:24:03,700
It was on my way. No trouble at all.

418
00:24:09,610 --> 00:24:11,810
Why didn't you drink your ginseng soup?

419
00:24:12,850 --> 00:24:15,110
This soup is just too bitter.

420
00:24:15,790 --> 00:24:16,920
What a coincidence.

421
00:24:17,240 --> 00:24:18,760
I heard Changxuan mention

422
00:24:19,140 --> 00:24:21,070
that you like zongzi candy before.

423
00:24:21,110 --> 00:24:22,750
I happened to pass by Yurong Pastry Shop.

424
00:24:22,750 --> 00:24:23,680
So I bought some.

425
00:24:28,010 --> 00:24:29,740
Thank you so much, Director Gu.

426
00:24:37,220 --> 00:24:38,820
-Fourth Lady.
-Fourth Lady.

427
00:24:43,720 --> 00:24:44,400
Jinxuan.

428
00:24:45,460 --> 00:24:46,220
Changxuan?

429
00:24:47,220 --> 00:24:47,850
Qiujuan.

430
00:24:48,180 --> 00:24:49,290
Go do your other things.

431
00:24:49,290 --> 00:24:49,810
Let me.

432
00:24:51,960 --> 00:24:53,760
Sit with me for a while, will you?

433
00:25:01,460 --> 00:25:02,610
I heard that pregnant women

434
00:25:02,610 --> 00:25:03,570
have a hard time.

435
00:25:03,940 --> 00:25:05,470
How are you feeling lately?

436
00:25:06,850 --> 00:25:08,110
It's been pretty good.

437
00:25:08,510 --> 00:25:09,660
I see Dr. Dai regularly for shots

438
00:25:09,660 --> 00:25:10,880
to support the pregnancy.

439
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:13,010
It's good to stay active. That's good.

440
00:25:13,110 --> 00:25:13,920
That's good.

441
00:25:14,700 --> 00:25:15,920
When he grows up

442
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,220
and can walk and run,

443
00:25:17,850 --> 00:25:19,070
as his uncle,

444
00:25:19,380 --> 00:25:20,660
I'll teach him how to ride a horse

445
00:25:20,660 --> 00:25:21,520
and go fishing.

446
00:25:22,610 --> 00:25:23,960
Since you like kids so much,

447
00:25:23,960 --> 00:25:25,760
why don't you have one yourself?

448
00:25:26,550 --> 00:25:27,920
Stop making fun of me.

449
00:25:28,850 --> 00:25:30,050
It's too early for me.

450
00:25:33,250 --> 00:25:34,050
Changxuan,

451
00:25:35,350 --> 00:25:38,010
Pingjun is a good girl,

452
00:25:38,720 --> 00:25:39,240
but she's not the type

453
00:25:39,240 --> 00:25:40,700
to be easily manipulated.

454
00:25:41,250 --> 00:25:42,570
Are you planning to keep

455
00:25:42,570 --> 00:25:44,610
some things to yourself forever

456
00:25:44,900 --> 00:25:45,960
and never tell her?

457
00:25:48,980 --> 00:25:50,000
You know that

458
00:25:50,590 --> 00:25:52,420
nothing stays hidden forever.

459
00:25:52,790 --> 00:25:54,400
If she finds out one day,

460
00:25:54,850 --> 00:25:57,550
do you think she can handle it?

461
00:26:00,220 --> 00:26:01,550
I understand, Jinxuan.

462
00:26:02,940 --> 00:26:04,180
I will tell her

463
00:26:04,310 --> 00:26:05,510
when I get the chance.

464
00:26:07,550 --> 00:26:08,700
Anyway,

465
00:26:08,700 --> 00:26:10,360
this is between the two of you.

466
00:26:10,750 --> 00:26:12,000
As your sister,

467
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:13,310
I can only give you a reminder.

468
00:26:13,310 --> 00:26:15,040
I can't make decisions for you.

469
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:17,220
It hasn't been easy for you and Pingjun

470
00:26:17,220 --> 00:26:18,820
to get to where you are today.

471
00:26:19,700 --> 00:26:20,770
I just hope

472
00:26:21,480 --> 00:26:24,050
you two will be well in the future.

473
00:26:39,110 --> 00:26:40,240
Fifth Young Master.

474
00:26:40,570 --> 00:26:42,920
You've been coming back late
these past few days.

475
00:26:42,920 --> 00:26:44,400
I specifically had the small kitchen

476
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:46,030
make lotus leaf soup for you.

477
00:26:46,220 --> 00:26:48,250
It's very refreshing. Please try it.

478
00:26:48,250 --> 00:26:49,710
How is Madam's mood today?

479
00:26:50,380 --> 00:26:51,510
How is her appetite?

480
00:26:52,010 --> 00:26:54,000
How would we know

481
00:26:54,160 --> 00:26:55,420
how the Young Madam is?

482
00:26:55,940 --> 00:26:57,700
You should ask Director Gu.

483
00:27:02,350 --> 00:27:03,290
What do you mean?

484
00:27:03,900 --> 00:27:05,850
We maids are clumsy.

485
00:27:06,170 --> 00:27:06,780
Usually,

486
00:27:06,810 --> 00:27:08,960
we can't do much
to help with taking care of

487
00:27:08,960 --> 00:27:10,310
the Fifth Young Madam.

488
00:27:10,660 --> 00:27:11,660
The Young Madam

489
00:27:11,660 --> 00:27:12,750
is literate.

490
00:27:12,750 --> 00:27:14,610
She doesn't have much to say to us.

491
00:27:14,900 --> 00:27:15,700
But with Director Gu,

492
00:27:15,700 --> 00:27:17,760
she has endless things to talk about.

493
00:27:18,150 --> 00:27:19,480
It's actually strange.

494
00:27:19,790 --> 00:27:21,960
Director Gu usually looks cold,

495
00:27:22,460 --> 00:27:24,500
but whenever he sees the Young Madam,

496
00:27:24,500 --> 00:27:26,110
he becomes gentle.

497
00:27:27,850 --> 00:27:28,980
Fifth Young Master!

498
00:27:31,090 --> 00:27:32,380
One is my brother,

499
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:34,810
and the other is my wife.

500
00:27:37,900 --> 00:27:38,900
If I hear you making up

501
00:27:38,900 --> 00:27:40,100
such nonsense again,

502
00:27:41,090 --> 00:27:42,220
I'll take your life.

503
00:27:44,880 --> 00:27:45,440
Get out.

504
00:27:53,700 --> 00:27:55,510
Fengtai has its own merits,

505
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:57,700
but the garden in Yu's Residence
is also beautiful.

506
00:27:57,700 --> 00:27:58,960
Isn't it, Young Madam?

507
00:28:10,500 --> 00:28:11,790
This is a hosta.

508
00:28:11,900 --> 00:28:14,300
It's easy to grow
and can survive anywhere.

509
00:28:31,960 --> 00:28:33,980
Young Madam, are you alright?

510
00:28:34,500 --> 00:28:35,360
What happened?

511
00:28:36,290 --> 00:28:37,420
Fifth Young Master.

512
00:28:37,920 --> 00:28:40,120
The Young Madam is feeling a bit unwell.

513
00:28:41,480 --> 00:28:42,280
What's wrong?

514
00:28:43,810 --> 00:28:44,740
I'm fine.

515
00:28:44,880 --> 00:28:46,960
Maybe the wind was a bit strong just now.

516
00:28:46,960 --> 00:28:48,960
It gave me a headache. It's nothing.

517
00:28:53,050 --> 00:28:54,110
What are you doing?

518
00:28:54,700 --> 00:28:55,760
What are you doing?

519
00:28:55,830 --> 00:28:57,550
Yu Changxuan, put... put me down.

520
00:28:57,550 --> 00:28:58,830
I can walk by myself.

521
00:29:05,550 --> 00:29:06,610
Hurry up.

522
00:29:21,440 --> 00:29:22,500
What are you doing?

523
00:29:23,810 --> 00:29:25,410
Do you want me to walk faster?

524
00:29:35,380 --> 00:29:35,980
Yes.

525
00:29:44,330 --> 00:29:45,770
Call me Changxuan.

526
00:29:47,370 --> 00:29:48,830
I haven't heard it all day.

527
00:29:49,830 --> 00:29:50,770
I miss it so much.

528
00:30:00,420 --> 00:30:01,220
Changxuan.

529
00:30:05,740 --> 00:30:06,660
Why does it sound so good

530
00:30:06,660 --> 00:30:07,570
when you say it?

531
00:30:44,740 --> 00:30:45,270
Hello?

532
00:30:47,770 --> 00:30:49,030
Okay. Okay.

533
00:30:49,030 --> 00:30:49,940
I got it.

534
00:30:51,940 --> 00:30:52,770
Young Madam!

535
00:30:52,770 --> 00:30:54,400
-What's wrong?
-Young Madam.

536
00:30:54,400 --> 00:30:55,370
Master Jin from Xiangxi Hotel

537
00:30:55,370 --> 00:30:56,440
called for Fifth Young Master Yu,

538
00:30:56,440 --> 00:30:59,240
saying Miss Lan Qing
is having opium withdrawals.

539
00:31:02,180 --> 00:31:03,180
Get the car ready.

540
00:31:08,310 --> 00:31:09,040
Opium paste!

541
00:31:09,220 --> 00:31:10,120
Opium paste!

542
00:31:16,590 --> 00:31:17,450
Opium paste...

543
00:31:27,290 --> 00:31:27,940
Lan Qing.

544
00:31:28,270 --> 00:31:28,830
Lan Qing.

545
00:31:29,110 --> 00:31:32,270
Opium paste!
Where did you hide the opium paste?

546
00:31:32,380 --> 00:31:33,650
Give it to me!

547
00:31:33,770 --> 00:31:34,330
Lan Qing!

548
00:31:34,330 --> 00:31:36,180
Give it to me!

549
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:49,110
Lan Qing.

550
00:31:52,660 --> 00:31:53,270
Pingjun?

551
00:31:56,570 --> 00:31:57,900
What are you doing here?

552
00:31:58,200 --> 00:31:59,930
Where is Fifth Young Master Yu?

553
00:32:00,510 --> 00:32:02,800
Changxuan had to go on patrol.

554
00:32:03,140 --> 00:32:04,740
I heard something happened to Lan Qing,

555
00:32:04,740 --> 00:32:05,800
so I came to see her.

556
00:32:09,050 --> 00:32:10,100
Ye Pingjun.

557
00:32:12,770 --> 00:32:14,100
What are you doing here?

558
00:32:18,940 --> 00:32:20,530
Are you here to laugh at me?

559
00:32:34,010 --> 00:32:35,070
Lan Qing.

560
00:32:36,730 --> 00:32:38,690
I know you are suffering right now.

561
00:32:40,850 --> 00:32:42,780
But you must hold on.

562
00:32:52,040 --> 00:32:52,620
Stop!

563
00:32:52,650 --> 00:32:53,760
You can't use this!

564
00:32:54,000 --> 00:32:54,700
Let me go!

565
00:32:54,720 --> 00:32:55,860
-Lan Qing!
-Lan Qing!

566
00:32:55,860 --> 00:32:57,180
Leave me alone!

567
00:32:57,280 --> 00:32:57,920
-Lan Qing!
-I don't...

568
00:32:57,920 --> 00:32:58,830
Calm down!

569
00:33:10,810 --> 00:33:11,740
Don't be afraid.

570
00:33:12,790 --> 00:33:13,770
It's okay now.

571
00:33:14,240 --> 00:33:15,040
It's okay now.

572
00:33:16,380 --> 00:33:17,910
It's okay. Don't be afraid.

573
00:33:20,420 --> 00:33:21,380
It's okay.

574
00:33:43,140 --> 00:33:44,170
Lan Qing.

575
00:33:46,680 --> 00:33:47,810
Ye Pingjun.

576
00:33:48,480 --> 00:33:50,480
Stop pretending to be a good person!

577
00:33:51,550 --> 00:33:53,240
I hurt you so much before.

578
00:33:54,660 --> 00:33:56,270
Shouldn't you hate me?

579
00:34:01,480 --> 00:34:02,770
I don't hate you.

580
00:34:06,740 --> 00:34:08,070
Because I know

581
00:34:09,630 --> 00:34:11,360
this isn't the real you.

582
00:34:25,230 --> 00:34:26,570
I don't want to see you!

583
00:34:26,670 --> 00:34:27,639
Get out!

584
00:34:27,760 --> 00:34:28,710
I don't want to see you!

585
00:34:28,710 --> 00:34:30,199
Get out!

586
00:34:30,590 --> 00:34:31,460
Lan Qing.

587
00:34:31,630 --> 00:34:33,280
Go back and treat your wound first.

588
00:34:33,280 --> 00:34:34,540
I'm here. Don't worry.

589
00:34:37,760 --> 00:34:38,280
But...

590
00:34:38,300 --> 00:34:39,179
Trust me.

591
00:34:40,170 --> 00:34:40,980
I'm here.

592
00:34:51,550 --> 00:34:52,230
Go.

593
00:35:06,500 --> 00:35:07,190
Lan Qing.

594
00:35:10,480 --> 00:35:11,280
It's okay now.

595
00:35:13,110 --> 00:35:14,010
It's okay now.

596
00:35:32,280 --> 00:35:36,620
[Yuchun Theater]

597
00:35:39,420 --> 00:35:40,380
Jin.

598
00:35:42,820 --> 00:35:44,840
Why bother caring about me?

599
00:35:48,170 --> 00:35:51,000
It's better to just let me die.

600
00:36:06,480 --> 00:36:08,540
Whether it's a highly effective drug

601
00:36:09,670 --> 00:36:11,230
or the best doctor,

602
00:36:12,420 --> 00:36:13,210
Lan Qing,

603
00:36:14,200 --> 00:36:15,530
neither one can help you

604
00:36:16,760 --> 00:36:18,090
get over this hurdle.

605
00:36:19,210 --> 00:36:20,740
You have to rely on yourself

606
00:36:22,940 --> 00:36:25,000
and grit your teeth to get through it.

607
00:36:50,630 --> 00:36:52,340
Mingxuan once told me

608
00:36:53,900 --> 00:36:56,940
that when a star is on stage,

609
00:36:58,530 --> 00:36:59,920
even if the sky falls,

610
00:37:02,650 --> 00:37:04,580
they must finish the performance.

611
00:37:10,510 --> 00:37:17,380
Bravo! Bravo!

612
00:37:20,530 --> 00:37:21,940
The Lan Qing he knows

613
00:37:24,530 --> 00:37:26,260
keeps singing whether there is

614
00:37:27,380 --> 00:37:28,610
an audience or not,

615
00:37:30,480 --> 00:37:32,340
and she never gives up

616
00:37:33,820 --> 00:37:36,020
no matter what difficulties she faces.

617
00:38:07,460 --> 00:38:09,920
Pingjun, you're so thoughtful.

618
00:38:10,260 --> 00:38:11,260
You prepared so many things

619
00:38:11,260 --> 00:38:12,500
for me and the baby.

620
00:38:14,260 --> 00:38:16,720
And you even sewed
a herbal pillow yourself?

621
00:38:18,260 --> 00:38:18,980
Jinxuan,

622
00:38:19,510 --> 00:38:21,300
we are family now.

623
00:38:21,440 --> 00:38:24,500
I'm happy to do this.

624
00:38:27,050 --> 00:38:28,380
You're such a good girl.

625
00:38:29,510 --> 00:38:31,210
Sometimes Changxuan can be

626
00:38:31,380 --> 00:38:32,820
a bit bossy.

627
00:38:33,320 --> 00:38:34,940
But I've seen

628
00:38:34,940 --> 00:38:36,600
everything he's done for you.

629
00:38:37,500 --> 00:38:40,960
He is truly devoted to you.

630
00:38:44,690 --> 00:38:46,170
If he ever

631
00:38:46,260 --> 00:38:48,190
does anything wrong in the future,

632
00:38:48,510 --> 00:38:49,860
I hope you

633
00:38:49,940 --> 00:38:51,760
can give him a chance

634
00:38:52,150 --> 00:38:53,810
for the sake of his sincerity.

635
00:39:00,210 --> 00:39:01,190
I understand.

636
00:39:02,190 --> 00:39:03,070
Don't worry.

637
00:39:03,630 --> 00:39:06,420
We are doing great.

638
00:39:09,860 --> 00:39:10,990
By the way, Jinxuan,

639
00:39:11,050 --> 00:39:13,310
let me adjust this herbal pillow for you.

640
00:39:13,320 --> 00:39:14,360
I'll make sure the herbs inside

641
00:39:14,360 --> 00:39:15,650
are evenly distributed.

642
00:39:15,650 --> 00:39:16,570
That way, you'll sleep

643
00:39:16,570 --> 00:39:18,100
more comfortably at night.

644
00:39:24,440 --> 00:39:25,370
I'll put it here.

645
00:40:18,550 --> 00:40:19,360
Lan Qing.

646
00:40:21,360 --> 00:40:22,090
Lan Qing?

647
00:40:24,050 --> 00:40:25,780
Come look at your new costumes.

648
00:40:28,280 --> 00:40:30,210
Don't buy me new costumes anymore.

649
00:40:31,550 --> 00:40:34,610
They'd just go to waste on me.

650
00:40:41,300 --> 00:40:42,000
It's okay.

651
00:40:43,260 --> 00:40:44,960
The audience
wasn't very enthusiastic today.

652
00:40:44,960 --> 00:40:47,560
The audience was small.
Don't be discouraged.

653
00:40:47,760 --> 00:40:49,020
It will only get better

654
00:40:49,150 --> 00:40:50,820
day by day.

655
00:40:52,150 --> 00:40:53,050
Day by day?

656
00:40:54,280 --> 00:40:56,410
I come from the lowest rung of society.

657
00:40:57,420 --> 00:40:59,010
My life is like a weed
drifting in the wind.

658
00:40:59,010 --> 00:41:01,010
How can I even think about tomorrow?

659
00:41:01,360 --> 00:41:02,900
If someone supports me,

660
00:41:02,900 --> 00:41:03,920
I am a star.

661
00:41:04,820 --> 00:41:06,320
If no one does,

662
00:41:07,610 --> 00:41:09,710
I'll be begging on the street corner.

663
00:41:15,210 --> 00:41:16,010
Lan Qing,

664
00:41:16,860 --> 00:41:17,710
you are a star.

665
00:41:19,210 --> 00:41:20,010
It's not because of anyone's

666
00:41:20,010 --> 00:41:21,340
admiration or support.

667
00:41:22,610 --> 00:41:25,070
It's because of your talent, hard work,

668
00:41:25,420 --> 00:41:26,550
and achievements.

669
00:41:27,320 --> 00:41:29,050
It's because you are yourself.

670
00:41:30,820 --> 00:41:31,950
I don't understand.

671
00:41:32,900 --> 00:41:34,010
You must

672
00:41:34,590 --> 00:41:36,300
always put yourself first.

673
00:41:37,010 --> 00:41:39,300
Respect yourself and love yourself.

674
00:41:45,260 --> 00:41:46,230
Do you know

675
00:41:47,110 --> 00:41:47,860
when

676
00:41:47,890 --> 00:41:49,090
I started liking you?

677
00:41:50,260 --> 00:41:51,170
Since when?

678
00:41:53,050 --> 00:41:55,260
It was raining heavily that day.

679
00:41:56,360 --> 00:41:57,620
There was no audience,

680
00:41:57,900 --> 00:42:00,030
and you didn't have suitable clothes.

681
00:42:00,980 --> 00:42:01,590
But you still

682
00:42:01,590 --> 00:42:04,050
finished performing "The Peony Pavilion."

683
00:42:04,130 --> 00:42:06,380
[Where Music Lingers and Clouds Pause]

684
00:42:25,900 --> 00:42:26,690
Bravo!

685
00:42:39,110 --> 00:42:40,050
Young Master.

686
00:42:41,010 --> 00:42:42,260
I'm not a star.

687
00:42:43,260 --> 00:42:44,500
Why did you stay in the rain

688
00:42:44,500 --> 00:42:46,430
to watch my performance to the end?

689
00:42:46,710 --> 00:42:48,650
A performance
shouldn't be left unfinished.

690
00:42:48,650 --> 00:42:50,710
Even if the sky falls,
it must be finished.

691
00:42:50,710 --> 00:42:53,090
That's what makes a true star.

692
00:43:20,500 --> 00:43:21,380
Mingxuan?

693
00:43:24,360 --> 00:43:25,570
Is that you?

694
00:43:32,920 --> 00:43:33,710
Lan Qing.

695
00:43:35,150 --> 00:43:35,760
Do you still remember

696
00:43:35,760 --> 00:43:37,010
what I told you?

697
00:43:40,360 --> 00:43:41,150
I do.

698
00:43:42,610 --> 00:43:45,210
Heaven loves those who love themselves.

699
00:43:46,550 --> 00:43:48,480
No matter how bad the situation is,

700
00:43:48,500 --> 00:43:50,700
as long as you don't give up on yourself,

701
00:43:51,210 --> 00:43:53,250
no one can break your spirit.

702
00:43:58,860 --> 00:44:00,070
So promise me,

703
00:44:06,550 --> 00:44:07,860
no matter what,

704
00:44:09,420 --> 00:44:11,010
take good care of yourself.

705
00:44:13,650 --> 00:44:15,090
Keep yourself safe.

706
00:44:54,820 --> 00:44:57,350
A performance
shouldn't be left unfinished.

707
00:44:59,540 --> 00:45:00,860
Even if the sky falls,

708
00:45:03,050 --> 00:45:04,320
it must be finished.

709
00:45:47,840 --> 00:45:50,100
So it's the Yu family's good son-in-law.

710
00:45:54,760 --> 00:45:55,890
Are you sitting here

711
00:45:57,000 --> 00:45:59,800
because you think
you're not conspicuous enough?

712
00:46:01,400 --> 00:46:04,060
I was sitting here
waiting to congratulate you.

713
00:46:09,610 --> 00:46:12,010
Now that Yu Jinxuan is pregnant,

714
00:46:12,690 --> 00:46:16,210
you'll get a share of the Yu family's
property sooner or later.

715
00:46:18,070 --> 00:46:19,500
You no longer have to stand

716
00:46:19,500 --> 00:46:21,160
on the edge of the cliff with me

717
00:46:21,710 --> 00:46:23,090
and take any risks.

718
00:46:25,010 --> 00:46:25,860
How nice.

719
00:46:26,920 --> 00:46:28,650
Shouldn't I congratulate you?

720
00:46:37,760 --> 00:46:39,020
It's such a good thing.

721
00:46:41,460 --> 00:46:42,260
Here.

722
00:46:44,650 --> 00:46:46,130
A toast to you.

723
00:46:48,420 --> 00:46:49,210
Wanqiao,

724
00:46:49,880 --> 00:46:50,680
you're drunk.

725
00:46:51,260 --> 00:46:52,110
I'll help you back.

726
00:46:52,110 --> 00:46:53,030
I'm not drunk!

727
00:46:55,030 --> 00:46:55,980
Kuang Bingwen.

728
00:46:58,280 --> 00:47:00,140
What did you promise me back then?

729
00:47:01,170 --> 00:47:02,170
You told me

730
00:47:03,070 --> 00:47:04,320
to stay by the old man's side

731
00:47:04,320 --> 00:47:05,850
to pass information to you.

732
00:47:06,760 --> 00:47:07,050
You said

733
00:47:07,050 --> 00:47:08,030
you married his daughter just

734
00:47:08,030 --> 00:47:09,400
to get power.

735
00:47:12,300 --> 00:47:13,320
You said all this was

736
00:47:13,320 --> 00:47:14,320
for revenge,

737
00:47:14,360 --> 00:47:15,610
that it was all fake.

738
00:47:17,860 --> 00:47:19,010
But what about now?

739
00:47:21,200 --> 00:47:22,630
You've made it real,

740
00:47:22,630 --> 00:47:23,590
haven't you?

741
00:47:30,070 --> 00:47:31,380
I know very well

742
00:47:33,710 --> 00:47:35,840
our purpose in coming to the Yu family.

743
00:47:38,860 --> 00:47:39,570
Is that so?

744
00:47:41,010 --> 00:47:42,150
Then tell me

745
00:47:44,690 --> 00:47:46,420
that you've never had feelings

746
00:47:47,000 --> 00:47:48,920
for Yu Jinxuan.

747
00:47:50,650 --> 00:47:52,210
Not even a little bit.

748
00:47:53,420 --> 00:47:54,210
Say it.

749
00:47:57,670 --> 00:47:58,570
Say it!

750
00:48:08,750 --> 00:48:10,000
You lied to me.

751
00:48:11,280 --> 00:48:12,880
For your plan,

752
00:48:13,770 --> 00:48:15,670
I married a man I don't love.

753
00:48:16,210 --> 00:48:18,920
And I even bore him a child.
